      <rules>
        <rule id="e206ffe0-8579-57ae-8852-31249138bd3f" name="PDF Entry Notes" hidden="false">
          <description>Composition base 5 models. Add up to 15 men at +4 pts each. Rifle-based Warden squad options include automatic rifles, Malone/Ratcatcher support weapons, grenade launchers, bicycles/motorbikes where listed, sticky grenades, and white ash impact grenades where listed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
