      <rules>
        <rule id="890ea903-4e5f-5330-a097-6cc469cd30ed" name="PDF Entry Notes" hidden="false">
          <description>Composition base 5 models. Add up to 5 men at +10 pts each. Rifle-based Warden squad options include automatic rifles, Malone/Ratcatcher support weapons, grenade launchers, bicycles/motorbikes where listed, sticky grenades, and white ash impact grenades where listed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
