      <rules>
        <rule id="9c2a769d-830b-502b-88ca-d675753a9183" name="PDF Entry Notes" hidden="false">
          <description>Composition base 5 models. Add up to 5 men at +13 pts each. Rifle-based Warden squad options include automatic rifles, Malone/Ratcatcher support weapons, grenade launchers, bicycles/motorbikes where listed, sticky grenades, and white ash impact grenades where listed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
