      <rules>
        <rule id="b7597ba1-34b2-53e2-ad57-4159622eed44" name="PDF Entry Notes" hidden="false">
          <description>Composition base 4 models. Add up to 6 men at +10 pts each. Rifle-based Warden squad options include automatic rifles, Malone/Ratcatcher support weapons, grenade launchers, bicycles/motorbikes where listed, sticky grenades, and white ash impact grenades where listed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
