      <rules>
        <rule id="f0be5f55-9d01-513b-ae9d-e0faf0b9a809" name="PDF Entry Notes" hidden="false">
          <description>Composition base 4 models. Add up to 6 men at +14 pts each. Rifle-based Warden squad options include automatic rifles, Malone/Ratcatcher support weapons, grenade launchers, bicycles/motorbikes where listed, sticky grenades, and white ash impact grenades where listed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
