      <rules>
        <rule id="b3aed096-b052-50ea-a890-4d204b5323ac" name="PDF Entry Notes" hidden="false">
          <description>Composition base 2 models. Add up to 8 men at +15 pts each. Rifle-based Warden squad options include automatic rifles, Malone/Ratcatcher support weapons, grenade launchers, bicycles/motorbikes where listed, sticky grenades, and white ash impact grenades where listed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
