        <rule id="7480a50a-9689-5723-b228-a275f7e99991" name="PDF Entry Notes" hidden="false">
          <description>Composition base 5 models. Add up to 5 men at +16 pts each. Rifle-based Warden squad options include automatic rifles, Malone/Ratcatcher support weapons, grenade launchers, bicycles/motorbikes where listed, sticky grenades, and white ash impact grenades where listed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
